    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumwiiko kukhola saba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khumaliilikha khwa buli mwiiko kukhola saba beela abo baali ne kamakobi kenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalakholwa kari: buli mundu yesi yesi owekopia kimiaandu khu Muisiraeli wasie alamubeela likobi lienelio. Akheenya owe likobi aruunge tawe. Mukhole murio sikila siise esio sili sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nisio alomile ali sibe sie khubeelanila kamakobi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyala mwakaanila nibio bakeni bekopa ne kakhali mukharuungana mwabene ne mwabene nibio mwekopiana tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omutaambi se alabaao mwinywe tawe sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alamubiita enywe chikhabi mu sibala nisio alikho amuelesia enywe nga kumukabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaba ne muba barekerefu mu khumuria niye ne khuuria kamalaka kewe koosi niko ndikho muelesia luno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alamubiita enywe chikhabi nga ne asuubisia. Mulekopia kimiaandu khu kholo chingali, ne kakhali enywe se mulekopa khu kholo yosi yosi tawe, mulamiia chikholo chingali ne kakhali nicho se chilamwamiiakho enywe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 25.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Omuisiraeli wasienywe aaba ne ali mwinywe mu lukoba lwosi lwosi khu ngoba che mu sibala nisio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alikho amuelesia okhali nende nibio eenya tawe, mukhaba ne chinge mulobe khuyeeta babanani tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, ba baani mala mubaelesie bikali nga ne benya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhanyoola chinganakani chimayaanu tawe, mukhaloba khukhwikopia babaasienywe baali babanani sisiindu, sikila kumwiiko kwe kamakobi kuli siimbi tawe. Mukhalekha kamabi nga ako kario kengila mu mebaasio kenywe tawe. Ne muloba khubekopia balalilila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala mulanyoolekhana khuuba bamayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baelesie mu bulekhuule ne mukhabeelela ne mulikho mubaelesia tawe. Kano kalakila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe amuelesie enywe chikhabi mu milimo kienywe kioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 26.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 14.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn. 12.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bataambi se balilekha khubao mu sibala sienywe tawe. Khwako ese mulaka enywe ndi aana mu bulekhuule khu bawandaayenywe bataambi ne babanani baali mwinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khulekhuula banasioobi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.39+LEV.25.40+LEV.25.41+LEV.25.42+LEV.25.43+LEV.25.44+LEV.25.45+LEV.25.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 25.39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Omuisiraeli wasio owe siseecha namwe owe siikhasi aaba ne ekusia omwene",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "omwene:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ekusia namwe bakhukusia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " khwiwe nga nasioobi, mulekhuule enyuma we khu khukholela ewe kimiiko sita. Ne kakhali mumwiiko kwa saba, mulekhe ache ne ali omulekhuule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ne olekhuula nasioobi khucha, akhacha makhono mataaka tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omulekhuula, okhamulekha aacha makhono mataaka tawe muelesie bilalakho khu nibio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhuelesie ewe nga chikhabi: kamakheese, biakhulia nende endali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khebulila oli mwesi mwaba banasioobi e Misiri mala Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe aamuelesia enywe bulekhuule. Lino nilio likila ese ne khuelesia ewe lilaka lino luno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne kakhali nasioobi wowo aaba ne akhenya khucha tawe, sikila aakhusiima ewe nende be nju yowo mala asienya khumenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mubukule omuyile amuliango kwenju yowo mala abwenao omufutulileo liiru liewe. Nono, alaba nasioobi wowo mu bulamu bwewe bwoosi. Kholela nasioobi wowo owe siikhasi mu ngila ng'ene eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhalola khuuba lilume ne olekhuula nasioobi tawe. Kakhaba kario, aakhukholeele ewe kimiiko sita mala aakholeele e nusu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "e nusu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "e nusu eye kumuruungo kwo mukholi ooandikwa namwe akholile kimilimo kikioola khabili nga omukholi omuandike.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " eye kumuruungo kwo mukholi ooandikwa khukhwola khabili. Khola lino, mala Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe naye alamuelesia enywe chikhabi mu koosi niko mukhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chikhaafu chimbele ne kamakheese",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
