        },
        {
          "text": " “Ra alubeka Khulwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe chiuunwa chimbele che chikhaafu choosi ne kamakheese. Mukharumikhirakho yosi yosi khu khaafu chino khu mulimo tawe. Lundi mukhabeka bufuumbo bwe likheese liosi liosi khu makheese kamabele ako tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mwiiko, enywe nende be chinju chenywe mukhalie bibiaayo abuundu niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi arobora, ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali sisiindu siibi siaaba ne sili khu biaayo ebio, biaaba ne bili bileme, namwe bibofu namwe sisiindu siibi lukali siosi siosi, mukhabikhola biaaba embosio khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali munyala mwaliila sisiaayo esio mu lukoba lwenywe. Omundu omukwalaafu namwe omunyaalu khuloondekhana ne kumwiima, anyala aabilia, bulayi bwene busa nga ne mulichanga enyama eya kicheu namwe eye ekhisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
